    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/d52970667a55976755de0691bcd2bdf4.avif?t=1750870593\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.poster.avif?t=1750870593\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.webm?t=1750870593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.mp4?t=1750870593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've spent years collecting the rarest and most precious hentai cards\u2026 but now they\u2019re gone! Someone scattered your beloved deck all over the house, and it\u2019s up to you to find them all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore 3D environments</strong> and uncover hidden cards in the most unexpected places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look under beds, behind furniture, and inside suspicious spots</strong> \u2013 they could be anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock spicy artwork and complete your lost deck</strong> as you recover each card.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fun, naughty, and surprising scavenger hunt! Can you reclaim your entire deck?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/e1c50ad0a499d66900e8bb5b19d4b666.avif?t=1750870593\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/d52970667a55976755de0691bcd2bdf4.avif?t=1750870593\" width=600 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.poster.avif?t=1750870593\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.webm?t=1750870593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/3e828d9ca57102a35607c263c2fa32a2.mp4?t=1750870593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've spent years collecting the rarest and most precious hentai cards\u2026 but now they\u2019re gone! Someone scattered your beloved deck all over the house, and it\u2019s up to you to find them all.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore 3D environments</strong> and uncover hidden cards in the most unexpected places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look under beds, behind furniture, and inside suspicious spots</strong> \u2013 they could be anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock spicy artwork and complete your lost deck</strong> as you recover each card.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a fun, naughty, and surprising scavenger hunt! Can you reclaim your entire deck?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515540/extras/e1c50ad0a499d66900e8bb5b19d4b666.avif?t=1750870593\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><ul class